{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:677ae80e99202ff0","name":"11-17-Series Mining Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-677ae80e99202ff0","title":"11-17-Series Mining Droid","revision":19616,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:17:13Z","sha256":"4e088ae5a27b40e1e618325b2444b12b9b0e04d3b9d6d26d1e5a8f026e4bdee8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19616","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=11-17-Series%20Mining%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-677ae80e99202ff0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The small Droid is low to the ground, and moves confidently on a pair of noisy treads. A single plasma jet projector emerges from a mount on the unit's back."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed by Roche as a Mining and Tunneling Droid, the 11-17-Series is a staple of miners and prospectors across the galaxy. Despite its small size, it is capable of performing work that a unit twice its size would find daunting. The Droids are not fitted with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vocabulators"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vocabulators"}," and communicate by means of dedicated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlinks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlinks"},". In situations where mine geography disrupts a direct signal, the 11-17-Series can \"bounce\" a signal in a chain from Droid to Droid. The Droids enjoy their work, intentionally working longer hours than normal to complete a job. They sometimes overwork themselves, occasionally putting off recharge and maintenance to their detriment.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The 11-17 is equipped with a Heavy Plasma Jet for digging. The Plasma Jet fires a blast four squares long by two squares wide. A target hit by the Droid's Plasma Jet takes 3d10 damage and moves -2 steps along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". In the event that the Plasma Jet misses, it deals only half damage and does not move the target along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The 11-17 also features a Saw and a Blowtorch for precision cutting and clearing obstacles. The Blowtorch counts as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with a range of 1 square.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["11-17-Series Mining Droids can't be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["11-17-Series Mining Droid Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["5th-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/5th-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +7\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic (understand only), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},", 1 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Refle